<title>NETHERLANDS: Consultant Twijnstra to buy two British firms.</title>
<headline>Consultant Twijnstra to buy two British firms.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch management consultant bureau Twijnstra Gudde said on Wednesday it had agreed to buy two British consultants, DEGW International Ltd and Marketing Improvements Group Plc (MIG).</p>
<p>DEGW has a turnover of about 16 million guilders and employs 130 staff. MIG employs 60 staff and has an annual turnover of some 12 million guilders.</p>
<p>Twinstra Gudde employs 500 staff and had turnover of 100 million guilders in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
